---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-[#0B132B] relative border-t border-[#CBAC70]/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Narrative Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#CBAC70] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] block">
          06 / THE STORY
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FDFCFF] leading-[1.12]">
          Clothing made to become part of your story.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#8E9BAE] leading-relaxed font-normal pt-2">
          <p>
            Malega Apparel lahir dengan satu visi sederhana: menciptakan busana modern yang terasa tepat di setiap saat dikenakan. Kami percaya bahwa keindahan sejati pakaian lahir dari proporsi potongan yang matang, sentuhan kain berkualitas tinggi, dan siluet yang tidak lekang oleh tren sesaat.
          </p>
          <p>
            Dari atelier kami di Indonesia, setiap karya diproduksi dengan dedikasi penuh terhadap detail jahitan, ketahanan serat kain, dan kenyamanan pemakainya.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#CBAC70]">
          <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#CBAC70]"></span>
          <span>Malega Apparel Atelier</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Visual Still -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-sm overflow-hidden bg-[#0E1736] border border-[#CBAC70]/20 group">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618354691373-d851c5c3a990?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=85"
            alt="Malega Apparel Atelier and Design Story"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
            width="800"
            height="1000"
          />

          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0B132B]/80 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none" />

          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-[#FDFCFF] font-medium">
              "Perfection is found not when there is nothing more to add, but when there is nothing left to take away."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
